rem Exit codes: the dry twin's 9, 8, 7, 6, 12, 5, 3, 4, then 10 app:start failed, 11 probe not ready, 13 app:stop failed, 3 again for a dist proof failure after the run, 0 when everything passed. Precedence after the run: 3, 10, 11, 13.
rem Afterwards the controller copies natively_debug.log from MAIN into the prestart folder of the validation hour, right after app:stop and before any other app start rotates it. The dir line below fingerprints the file as app:stop left it.
rem NOTE ON STYLE: no parentheses inside any echo in an if-block, see launch-h40d.cmd.
